==Descripton==
The '''Cookie Nametag''' is a nametag which was most likely meant to be obtained around the [[Operation I.C.E Event]], either as a battle pass reward or so that it can be rewarded alongside the [[Cookie Scout]] sticker. Its actual name is not known as it was not listed anywhere, therefore, it is referred to as '''Cookie Nametag''' on the wiki.

The '''Cookie Nametag''' has orange to dark brown gradient text with a translucent brown outline. A giant cookie emitting an orange aura can be seen on the top left corner of the nametag. Multiple bits of cookies also fall out of it.



